# SHA-256 baselines for CI-generated native macOS library screenshots.
# The library was redrawn inside the player window in this change, so no earlier hash applies.
# CI saves the shots as the mac-library-screenshots artifact. A hash is added here only after
# a person has looked at the picture from a CI run and approved it; until then the shot is
# saved and its hash written to the test output, and it does not fail the build.
# Once a shot has a line here it must match one of its lines: one per macos-26-arm64 runner
# image in service, since an image update can change the bytes with no visible change.
